 GitHub Action.","100% Free & Open Source – Contribute improvements, report issues, or suggest new features. Everyone is welcome."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Momen23344/gitVisualise/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c588acad7b8f57fd1e67e664352d70cf019e155f86a58139e3407edd935b0a0d","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:05.756Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:05.756Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"gitVisualise is a free tool that turns any GitHub repository into an interactive, narrated architecture tour. Instead of staring at confusing code files, you get a visual map that shows how different parts of a project connect. It's like having a guided tour guide for code.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Momen23344/gitVisualise/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"No technical jargon – just clear explanations like \"This file handles user login\" or \"This section manages the database connection.\"","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Momen23344/gitVisualise/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No account or registration required","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Momen23344/gitVisualise/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"c588acad7b8f57fd1e67e664352d70cf019e155f86a58139e3407edd935b0a0d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Momen23344/gitVisualise/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:05.756Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T07:12:25Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Momen23344/gitVisualise/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:05.757Z","hash":"c588acad7b8f57fd1e67e664352d70cf019e155f86a58139e3407edd935b0a0d","originalBytes":9412,"storedBytes":9412,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["gitvisualise","code","architecture","github","any","open","what","download","file","how","repository","documentation","narrated","new","paste","project","step","website","application","browser.","each",